sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Operator
    participant Login as Login Page
    participant Dashboard as Dashboard
    participant Patient as Data Pasien
    participant Checkup as Data Checkup
    participant System as Sistem (Naive Bayes)
    participant DB as Database

    %% Login Process
    User->>Login: Input Username & Password
    Login->>DB: Validasi Kredensial
    alt Login Berhasil
        DB-->>Login: Data Valid
        Login-->>User: Redirect ke Dashboard
    else Login Gagal
        DB-->>Login: Data Tidak Valid
        Login-->>User: Tampilkan Pesan Error
    end

    %% Patient Data Process
    User->>Dashboard: Pilih Menu Data Pasien
    User->>Patient: Input Data Pasien Baru / Cari Pasien
    Patient->>DB: Simpan / Ambil Data Pasien
    DB-->>Patient: Konfirmasi Penyimpanan / Data Pasien

    %% Checkup & Prediction Process
    User->>Patient: Pilih Pasien & Input Checkup
    Patient->>Checkup: Input Tensi, Gula Darah, BB, TB, dll
    Checkup->>System: Hitung BMI & Atribut Turunan
    System-->>Checkup: Hasil Perhitungan
    Checkup->>DB: Simpan Data Checkup
    
    User->>Checkup: Klik "Proses Prediksi"
    Checkup->>System: Request Prediksi Hipertensi
    System->>DB: Ambil Data Checkup Terakhir
    DB-->>System: Data Checkup
    
    activate System
    System->>System: Hitung Probabilitas (Naive Bayes)
    System->>System: Klasifikasi (Tidak/Cukup/Sangat Berpotensi)
    deactivate System
    
    System->>DB: Simpan Hasil Prediksi
    System-->>User: Tampilkan Hasil & Saran
